sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Settlement Agent
    participant Noesis as Noesis Pre-Commit Gate (Z3 5.4.1)
    participant Odoo as Odoo 18 GL (Locked Posting Sequence)
    participant NetSuite as NetSuite FX Treasury

    Agent->>Noesis: Batch Settlement ($40,000 USD -> EGP @ T1 rate 49.35, original invoice booked @ T0 49.20)
    Noesis->>Noesis: Check Fiscal Period Lock + Triangular FX Conservation (Delta = 6,000 EGP)

    alt Naive Retry / Unadjusted Amount Reversal
        Noesis-->>Agent: UNSAT ['INV_FX_REVALUATION_IMBALANCE_6000_EGP'] -> Blocked before ERP mutation
    else Exact Base-Currency Compensated Entry
        Noesis->>Odoo: Stage account.move.reversal (preserves T0 rate 49.20 + realized FX gain/loss 6,000 EGP line)
        Odoo-->>Noesis: Reversal Posted Cleanly (0 orphan reconcile links)
        Noesis->>NetSuite: Commit Paired Intercompany Entry (Debits == Credits in base & functional FX)
    end
